{"4475760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeons And Animals", "steam_appid": 4475760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon is more than just a battle; it’s also an opportunity. Use the resources you collect to build your own strength. Craft and upgrade your weapons, and use what you earn from dungeons to improve your equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/3d1b24bf9a9acc3826c7e0862f4a3b3f.poster.avif?t=1788166053\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/3d1b24bf9a9acc3826c7e0862f4a3b3f.webm?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/3d1b24bf9a9acc3826c7e0862f4a3b3f.mp4?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON, SURVIVE OR LOSE EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remnants of collapsed universes have been transformed into dungeons… You and your team must set out from the <strong>Sky’s Edge</strong> and venture into these dark worlds to survive. With support for <strong>1–6 player co-op</strong>, challenge the dungeons alone or dive in alongside your friends. With Souls-like combat mechanics, every battle demands focus, timing, and strategy. Defeat bosses, claim their treasures, but be careful: <strong>if you die, you could lose everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/188844c4609630a2a81083a3ea59b753.poster.avif?t=1788166053\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/188844c4609630a2a81083a3ea59b753.webm?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/188844c4609630a2a81083a3ea59b753.mp4?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon awaits you with its own unique enemies, dangers, and powerful boss battles. Fight your way through the depths of each dungeon with your friends, defeat the enemies you encounter, overcome obstacles, and work together as a team to clear your path. Discover the unique atmosphere and challenges of every dungeon, then face the powerful boss waiting for you at the end and claim your victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/5745ed675195b1ee092c424ad63b35d3.poster.avif?t=1788166053\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/5745ed675195b1ee092c424ad63b35d3.webm?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/5745ed675195b1ee092c424ad63b35d3.mp4?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon is more than just a battle; it’s also an opportunity. Use the resources you collect to build your own strength. Craft and upgrade your weapons, and use what you earn from dungeons to improve your equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/3d1b24bf9a9acc3826c7e0862f4a3b3f.poster.avif?t=1788166053\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/3d1b24bf9a9acc3826c7e0862f4a3b3f.webm?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/3d1b24bf9a9acc3826c7e0862f4a3b3f.mp4?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE DUNGEON, SURVIVE OR LOSE EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remnants of collapsed universes have been transformed into dungeons… You and your team must set out from the <strong>Sky’s Edge</strong> and venture into these dark worlds to survive. With support for <strong>1–6 player co-op</strong>, challenge the dungeons alone or dive in alongside your friends. With Souls-like combat mechanics, every battle demands focus, timing, and strategy. Defeat bosses, claim their treasures, but be careful: <strong>if you die, you could lose everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/188844c4609630a2a81083a3ea59b753.poster.avif?t=1788166053\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/188844c4609630a2a81083a3ea59b753.webm?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/188844c4609630a2a81083a3ea59b753.mp4?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dungeon awaits you with its own unique enemies, dangers, and powerful boss battles. Fight your way through the depths of each dungeon with your friends, defeat the enemies you encounter, overcome obstacles, and work together as a team to clear your path. Discover the unique atmosphere and challenges of every dungeon, then face the powerful boss waiting for you at the end and claim your victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/5745ed675195b1ee092c424ad63b35d3.poster.avif?t=1788166053\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/5745ed675195b1ee092c424ad63b35d3.webm?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/extras/5745ed675195b1ee092c424ad63b35d3.mp4?t=1788166053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dive into dungeons in a 1–6 player co-op souls-like experience, gather resources, craft powerful gear, and survive in a world where risk determines everything.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/bf443b3c5e74373aca1bfc14318970350e517188/header.jpg?t=1788166053", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/9d43eee3142a04e3866c83a739425126bb05b451/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788166053", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475760/9d43eee3142a04e3866c83a739425126bb05b451/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788166053", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gra